Fungal spores have colonized your blood, so that each time you use an infusion you store [25, 56, 107, 158, 209 (CON 10-100)] fungal power.

You may use this prodigy to release the power as a heal (never more than [100, 138, 184, 220, 249 (CON 10-100)] life) and remove up to 10 detrimental magical effects.

Fungal power lasts for up to 6 turns, losing the greater of 10 potency or 10% of its power each turn.

The amount of fungal power produced and the maximum heal possible increase with your Constitution and maximum life.
